1
00:00:00,798 --> 00:00:02,871
Stick. Stick. Stick. (yeah)

2
00:00:03,351 --> 00:00:04,947
Poke. Prod. Pop. (woo)

3
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,644
Got a little twig and a grin on my face,

4
00:00:13,882 --> 00:00:16,277
Walking through the room, slow-mo in place.

5
00:00:16,515 --> 00:00:18,829
Tap on the shoulder, boop on the nose,

6
00:00:19,068 --> 00:00:21,382
Little sticky note where the secret goes.

7
00:00:21,782 --> 00:00:24,015
They talk big, run their mouths in the light,

8
00:00:24,015 --> 00:00:26,649
We slide a sticky trap in the middle of the night.

9
00:00:26,649 --> 00:00:29,282
Not mean, just clever, a playful little trick,

10
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,552
Watch them fumble, watch them flick — stick stick stick.

11
00:00:32,871 --> 00:00:35,585
Whispered pranks, glitter trails, subtle and slick,

12
00:00:35,823 --> 00:00:38,457
No knives, no fights — just the sticky stick.

13
00:00:38,697 --> 00:00:41,090
Laugh till they sputter, can’t help but smile,

14
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:43,802
We’ve got finesse and a mischievous style.

15
00:00:43,883 --> 00:00:46,676
Sticky stick, poke and prod, watch ’em dance, watch ’em nod,

16
00:00:46,835 --> 00:00:49,387
Sticky stick, little wink, flip the script, do the stunt.

17
00:00:49,387 --> 00:00:52,021
Sticky stick, playful teeth, tap their pride underneath,

18
00:00:52,021 --> 00:00:55,213
Sticky stick — they trip, they slip, we keep the crown, we don’t quit.

19
00:00:55,213 --> 00:00:57,765
Glue of charm, tape of grace, velvet in the chase,

20
00:00:57,765 --> 00:01:00,399
We’re the prankers in the corner with the moonlit face.

21
00:01:00,637 --> 00:01:03,031
A poke in the ribs, a prod at their ego,

22
00:01:03,350 --> 00:01:05,745
We’re the gentle chaos where the wild flowers grow.

23
00:01:05,745 --> 00:01:08,138
They’ll remember the laughter, forget the smack,

24
00:01:08,138 --> 00:01:10,691
We leave a sticker on their jacket — then bounce back.

25
00:01:11,010 --> 00:01:13,483
No harm, just hustle, mischief in the mix,

26
00:01:13,563 --> 00:01:16,197
Call it artful warfare — the sticky stick fix.

27
00:01:16,516 --> 00:01:18,909
Stick it here, stick it there,

28
00:01:18,989 --> 00:01:21,222
Sticky secrets in the air.

29
00:01:21,382 --> 00:01:23,378
Soft little jabs, nothing to bleed,

30
00:01:23,378 --> 00:01:26,409
Just clever moves and a wickedly kind creed.

31
00:01:26,968 --> 00:01:29,920
Sticky stick, poke and prod, watch ’em dance, watch ’em nod,

32
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:32,233
Sticky stick, little wink, flip the script, do the stunt.

33
00:01:32,394 --> 00:01:34,947
Sticky stick, playful teeth, tap their pride underneath,

34
00:01:35,105 --> 00:01:38,378
Sticky stick — they trip, they slip, we keep the crown, we don’t quit.

35
00:01:39,972 --> 00:01:44,441
Stick. Stick. Stick.

36
